flowchart TB
    accTitle: Source dependencies of enrollment
    accDescr: The API depends on the use case, which depends on domain rules and a storage interface. The PostgreSQL adapter implements that business-owned interface; the use case does not depend on the concrete adapter.
    API["API · HTTP adapter"] --> USE["service · Enrollment use case"]
    USE --> DOMAIN["domain · Enrollment rules"]
    USE --> PORT["EnrollmentStore\nBusiness-owned interface"]
    DB["DB · PostgreSQL adapter"] -.->|"implements"| PORT
    classDef domain fill:#fff3be,stroke:#b6a355,color:#272722
    classDef contract fill:#eaf2ea,stroke:#7f9b7f,color:#272722
    class DOMAIN domain
    class PORT contract
